COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.family_key IS 'Tracker family key (lower).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.day IS 'Day (Meta ad account day).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.stage IS '''testing'' | ''scaling'' | ''unclassified'' (days with no campaign).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.spend IS 'Meta spend, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.purchases IS 'Upstack new customers credited.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.revenue IS 'First-order revenue of those customers, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.family_daily_upstack_nc.link_clicks IS 'Link clicks.';
