COMMENT ON TABLE public.unmatched_meta IS 'Meta families that map to no live tracker family, with the product guessed for them and their windowed and since-launch numbers. Closes the gap between ad_metrics and the account total. Grain: one row per Meta family (meta_family_key). Source: etl.build_metrics from meta_ads, ad_daily, meta_ad_lifetime, meta_campaigns, products.meta_regex. Refresh: nightly: TRUNCATE and rebuild. Coverage: 12K families (most never delivered since 2026-05-06; spend_launch can still be > 0). Caveats: product_id is a guess: from the family name (product_source ''name''), else the campaign of the family''s biggest ad (''campaign''), else the ad set name (''adset''), else ''none'' (the ''unassigned'' product). | Windows end on the last complete day. spend_all / purchases_all / revenue_all are over the days held in ad_daily (2026-05-06 on).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.meta_family_key IS 'lower(Meta ad family) (primary key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.meta_family IS 'Display name (the variant with the highest lifetime spend).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.product_id IS 'Guessed products.id.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.spend_7d IS 'Spend over the last 7 days, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.purchases_7d IS 'Purchases over the last 7 days.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.revenue_7d IS 'Purchase value over the last 7 days, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.spend_30d IS 'Spend over the last 30 days, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.purchases_30d IS 'Purchases over the last 30 days.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.revenue_30d IS 'Purchase value over the last 30 days, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.spend_all IS 'Spend over every day held in ad_daily, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.purchases_all IS 'Purchases over every day held.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.revenue_all IS 'Purchase value over every day held, dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.live IS 'true when the family spent on either of the last two days.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.spend_launch IS 'All-time lifetime spend (Meta API), dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.purchases_launch IS 'All-time lifetime purchases.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.unmatched_meta.revenue_launch IS 'All-time lifetime purchase value, dollars.';
