COMMENT ON TABLE public.etl_runs IS 'Log of every pipeline job run. analytics.etl_runs is the same table with the error cut to 500 characters. Grain: one row per job run. Source: etl.db.JobRun (own autocommit connection, so a failed job still leaves a ''failed'' row). Refresh: one row per run. Coverage: since 2026-11-04 UTC.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.id IS 'Run id.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.job IS 'Job name (run_daily, tracker_sync, meta_pull, lifetime_pull, status_refresh, build_metrics, upstack_daily, load_tags, load_hooks ...).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.started_at IS 'Start time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.finished_at IS 'Finish time (NULL while running).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.status IS 'running | ok | failed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.data_through IS 'Last data day covered, when the job has one.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.rows_written IS 'Rows written, when counted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.stats IS 'Job-specific JSON.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.etl_runs.error IS 'Scrubbed error text when failed.';
COMMENT ON TABLE public.app_meta IS 'Key / value facts about the data: window starts, data-through dates, last refresh status, timezone note, tagging reliability. Grain: one row per key. Source: written by the ETL jobs (etl.db.set_meta). Refresh: updated by the jobs that own each key. Coverage: 23 keys. Caveats: Keys include daily_start (2026-05-06, never moves), data_through, lifetime_cutoff (legacy 2026-09-17), lifetime_pulled_at, metrics_built_at, status_refreshed_at, upstack_first_day / upstack_through / upstack_built_at / upstack_pulled_at, google_first_day / google_through / google_upstack_first_day / google_built_at, last_ok_at / refresh_status / last_error, tz_note, tracker_row_count / tracker_blank_family_count, and reliability:<product slug> (blind re-tag agreement as JSON).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.app_meta.key IS 'Key (primary key).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.app_meta.value IS 'Value as text (some are JSON).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN public.app_meta.updated_at IS 'When the key was last written.';
